sequenceDiagram
    actor SuperAdmin
    participant Browser
    participant MVC as DoctorController
    participant Svc as DoctorService
    participant UoW as UnitOfWork
    participant DB as SQL Server

    SuperAdmin->>Browser: Open Doctor/SchedulePicker
    Browser->>MVC: GET SchedulePicker
    MVC->>Svc: GetDoctorsForSchedule()
    Svc->>DB: SELECT Doctors
    Svc-->>MVC: doctor list
    MVC-->>Browser: Doctor selection page

    SuperAdmin->>Browser: Select doctor
    Browser->>MVC: GET Availability(doctorId)
    MVC->>Svc: GetAvailabilityPage(doctorId)
    Svc->>DB: SELECT DoctorAvailabilities
    Svc-->>MVC: availability view model
    MVC-->>Browser: Weekly schedule form

    SuperAdmin->>Browser: Add availability slot
    Browser->>MVC: POST AddAvailability
    MVC->>MVC: Validate slot times

    MVC->>Svc: AddAvailability(model)
    Svc->>UoW: Add DoctorAvailability
    UoW->>DB: INSERT DoctorAvailabilities
    DB-->>Svc: new slot Id
    Svc-->>MVC: success
    MVC-->>Browser: Redirect Availability page

    SuperAdmin->>Browser: Open Doctor/Schedule(doctorId)
    Browser->>MVC: GET Schedule
    MVC->>Svc: GetScheduleView(doctorId)
    Svc->>DB: SELECT Availabilities and Appointments
    Svc-->>MVC: calendar view model
    MVC-->>Browser: Schedule grid

    Note over SuperAdmin,DB: AppointmentController uses these slots via GetAvailableSlots when booking
